{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Contain retained-size inspection failures.** Inspection still accesses overridable attributes; for example, a `functools.partial` subclass can raise from `func`. The exception escapes `schedule()`, causing terminal emission to exit before state cleanup and lose the record. Catch estimation failures here and pass lanes an over-budget size so stale same-ARN snapshots are also removed; add a plugin-level cleanup regression.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7s7fBP","finding_digest":"f4df3e346f230bf88b207f4fc604ce8f14adaa27bbc2bb2d01fe957f71c8baae","finding_id":"arf_v1_6tpt4ndpemf7rczap5h4mbgor4","finding_key":"insight/_export_scheduler.py::_exportscheduler.schedule::retained-sizing-exception-containment","identity_key":"insight/_export_scheduler.py::_exportscheduler.schedule::retained-sizing-exception-containment","line":571,"observation_digest":"dbd16a237d3354c3bbcbf371b7a1c67cecc9bf401ab22d704c73b8e7b1e36d95","observation_id":"aro_v1_3piwui35gnkmho6l6ny3piogpt","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-insight/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_insight/_export_scheduler.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-10T02:50:40Z","review_id":"arr_v1_k4hrjqgchgrlblks6ft3hhim26","reviewed_base_sha":"630b7771cedb1cf561e6ac29d49b84b6291db6b4","reviewed_head_sha":"4bd5e14f415ee5f249d3e4ff6501b023bcf916f7","reviewer":"codex","start_line":571,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":702},"record_id":"art_v1_vxaqgwnqwd6e6sccz33fuj5u5l","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-10T02:50:40Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
